#
# Conectamente — pre-commit gate.
#
# Runs in this order:
#   1. lint-staged → eslint --fix on staged TS/TSX files (auto-fixes simple
#      issues and re-stages them).
#   2. typecheck   → tsc --noEmit on the whole project. Faster than build
#      but catches every TS error. Pre-commit is the right moment for this:
#      we'd rather block a commit than push a broken build.
#
# If either step fails, the commit is aborted. Use `git commit --no-verify`
# only in genuine emergencies — and fix the underlying issue right after.
#
npx lint-staged
npm run typecheck
